        "TileImage": "$($repository 1af43e4a-5b91-45f4-8374-0a4e059adacc).Image",
        "Description": "Agent 47 DO NOT FAIL THIS TASK the following targets are no ordinary DJs they are a part of a crime group known as the Wild Blur. Julius is their crime leader and we suspect that they plan to rob the place and reveal confidential info that will ruin us! If anyone sees you the group will be informed and reveal the info. Be warned there are hired agents that know what you look like and are being paid thousands to find you. Good luck agent 47 you are the only one left to stop this.",
